{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "在中央工作会议上对文学艺术的指示（一九六三年九月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n041)\n在中央工作会议上对文学艺术的指示\n（一九六三年九月）\n戏剧要推陈出新，不应推陈出陈，光唱帝王将相，才子佳人和他们的丫头保镖之类。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-f0db3119a9b0208ba703", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-041.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "8d51e4b2220faa0dd5a421ac422825b381d9e65b3f3eff5d5453bc9236a60c1c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "7743de77d720c3e67be681737019a969b90169ed03e4e90720bd1e5837947550", "text_chars": 144}
